			"hadithnumber": 1760,
			"arabicnumber": 1760,
			"text": "Narrated Al-Bara' bin 'Azib: \"The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) prohibited riding (while sitting on) Miyathir.\" [Abu 'Eisa said:] There are narrations on this topic from 'Ali and Mu'awiyah. The Hadith if Al-Bara' is Hasan Sahih. Shu'bah reported similarly from Ash'ath bin Abi Ash-Sha'tha' in the lengthy Hadith",
